# After editing app/package code

Before finishing your turn:

1. Open `.specify/checklists/post-change-security-memory.md`
2. Mentally verify every checkbox against the diff you just wrote
3. Fix any FAIL items immediately
4. End your reply with:

```
Security: PASS|FAIL — …
Memory: PASS|FAIL — …
```

Watch especially for: missing effect cleanup, realtime channels, timers, unbounded arrays, PII in logs, client-trusted auth.
